invariant: INV-14
file: srv_resume.c
catches: srv_flight_test
reason: a ticket resumes a connection that negotiated another application
  protocol than the one it was issued under. srv_resume.h binds the
  protocol because an application may carry state across a resumption
  (RFC 9001 §4.5, rfc9001.txt:752-754), and a ticket that crossed
  protocols would carry one protocol's session into another.
  test/srv_resume_tests.h issues a ticket under h2 and requires it to be
  passed over by a connection that selects http/1.1.

--- old
    return c->alpn_len == p->name_len && ct_memeq(c->alpn, p->name, p->name_len);
--- new
    (void)p;
    return 1;
